  <item>
    <title>Brevard: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/brevard-nc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-brevard-nc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>90-day moratorium (Ord 2026-11) while city staff drafted UDO text amendments; the ordinance states its own expiry as July 2, 2026. Council adopted permanent data center regulations in Ord 2026-19 on May 18, 2026, ending the need for the pause.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Columbus County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/columbus-county-nc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-columbus-county-nc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
